<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details Q2 income, sales.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details Q2 income, sales.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas</p>
<p>monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its Q2 1997</p>
<p>consolidated income statement. Figures in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>    Item				 Q2 1997  Pct change from 1996</p>
<p>  Total Sales			    7,756		    9.3</p>
<p>  Domestic Sales			 5,096		   21.4</p>
<p>  Export Sales			   2,660		   -8.1</p>
<p>  Costs, Operating Expenses	  2,678		   40.7</p>
<p>Income before taxes, interests</p>
<p>   royalties, other expenses	 5,078		   -2.2</p>
<p>  Income before taxes, royalties   5,296		    0.7</p>
<p>  Taxes, Royalties		     4,626		    3.7</p>
<p>  Net Income				 670		  -16.1</p>
<p>  Operating Income Before Taxes    4,241		  -10.0</p>
<p>  Pemex Exploration &amp; Production   4,178		   -9.6</p>
<p>  Pemex Refinacion			(36)		 -179.6</p>
<p>  Pemex Gas				   69		    0.2</p>
<p>  Pemex Petrochemicals		    31		   -6.2</p>
<p>Legend: Statement is unaudited, *includes consumer taxes.</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
